SUMMARY:Application deadline: San Antonio Pro Chapter Scholarships
URL:http://spjsa.org/2026/03/26/spjsa-scholarships-2026-27-academic-year/
DESCRIPTION:Students who attend a San Antonio/South Texas college/university OR have a permanent residence in the San Antonio/South Texas region may apply. 

Applicants must be a mass communications/journalism major or have a demonstrated interest in journalism through work samples. They must be enrolled in college full-time (12-hour course load or more per semester) during the entire 2026-2027 academic year or be graduating in December 2026. 
LOCATION:
END:VEVENT





